[en.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT]
Last Resort

[en.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT_desc]
Some ponies say that war is the last resort of diplomacy. Well, you’ve tried everything else, and it’s time to bring out the big guns.

[en.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions to unify the Equestrian Wasteland by force：§YUnification War§!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT]
最后手段

[zh.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT_desc]
有的小马说，战争是外交的最后手段。好吧，现在你已经尝试了其他一切，是时候拿出重量级的东西了。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_LAST_RESORT_TOOLTIP]
解锁通过武力推动小马利亚统一的系列决议：§Y统一战争§!

